1
00:00:00,255 --> 00:00:01,464
Four sun gods.

2
00:00:01,608 --> 00:00:03,771
And according to the texts, only three

3
00:00:03,582 --> 00:00:04,637
of them are the sun.

4
00:00:05,025 --> 00:00:06,771
Ask who the Greek sun god is,

5
00:00:06,801 --> 00:00:07,714
and you will hear:

6
00:00:07,689 --> 00:00:08,372
Apollo.

7
00:00:08,736 --> 00:00:10,932
But in Homer and the Hymns, Apollo

8
00:00:10,743 --> 00:00:12,368
is the archer of Delos and the

9
00:00:12,179 --> 00:00:13,224
god of Delphi.

10
00:00:13,364 --> 00:00:14,595
He is not the sun.

11
00:00:15,001 --> 00:00:17,021
The Greek sun is Helios, son of

12
00:00:16,832 --> 00:00:17,635
Hyperion:

13
00:00:17,720 --> 00:00:19,488
he crosses the sky in his chariot,

14
00:00:19,474 --> 00:00:21,210
and sees and hears all things.

15
00:00:21,597 --> 00:00:23,244
When the men of Odysseus eat his

16
00:00:23,055 --> 00:00:25,273
cattle, he threatens to go down and

17
00:00:25,084 --> 00:00:26,314
shine among the dead.

18
00:00:26,694 --> 00:00:28,637
Sol is Helios in Latin.

19
00:00:28,754 --> 00:00:30,971
But Ovid calls the Sun Phoebus, the

20
00:00:30,782 --> 00:00:32,276
name Homer gives Apollo.

21
00:00:32,422 --> 00:00:33,839
That is where they blend.

22
00:00:34,215 --> 00:00:36,290
Ra is the sun, and also king

23
00:00:36,101 --> 00:00:36,959
of the gods.

24
00:00:37,103 --> 00:00:39,288
And every night he crosses the underworld

25
00:00:39,099 --> 00:00:40,012
in his boat.

26
00:00:40,371 --> 00:00:41,349
To remember it:

27
00:00:41,446 --> 00:00:42,632
who sees everything?

28
00:00:42,752 --> 00:00:44,125
Helios and Sol.

29
00:00:44,265 --> 00:00:45,617
Who rules everything?

30
00:00:45,738 --> 00:00:46,190
Ra.

31
00:00:46,001 --> 00:00:46,694
Apollo:

32
00:00:46,757 --> 00:00:47,407
neither.

33
00:00:47,791 --> 00:00:49,701
Before you believe a myth, ask:

34
00:00:49,764 --> 00:00:51,050
which text says so?

35
00:00:51,422 --> 00:00:53,420
Save it, and send it to anyone

36
00:00:53,231 --> 00:00:55,163
who says Apollo is the sun god.

